  lines:
  - speaker: Mage
    expression: 0
    text: Two armies are marching on the core...
  - speaker: Mage
    expression: 3
    text: 'I can''t fight either of them.

      Not even a little.'
  - speaker: Mage
    expression: 2
    text: Wait. They hate each other more than they hate me?
  - speaker: Mage
    expression: 1
    text: If I can make them meet, they will wear each other down!
